name(s) of the host system.  If there is more than one name for a
system, the names are separated by vertical bars.  After the name
of the system comes the fields of the description.  A field  name
followed  by  an  ‘=’  sign  indicates a string value follows.  A
field name followed by a ‘#’ sign indicates a  following  numeric
